$DATUM 7732-18-5
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM (3E,4E)-3-((6-Methoxybenzo[d]thiazol-2-yl)(phenyl)methylene)-5-phenylpent-4-en-2-ol
(6): A mixture of iodobenzene (4·10-3 mL, 0.034, 1 equiv), oxaborol 3a
(18.4 mg, 0.051 mmol, 1.5 equiv), K3PO4 (10.7 mg, 0.051 mmol, 1.5 equiv),
DMF-H2O (0.2 mL-0.03 mL) and Pd(PPh3)4 (7.8 mg, 6.7·10-3 mmol, 0.2 equiv)
was stirred at 80 °C for 2 h under Ar. At the end of the reaction, the
mixture was cooled and extracted with toluene. The organic layer was
washed with brine and dried over MgSO4, filtered and concentrated in
vacuo. The residue was purified by column chromatography over silica
using an hexane/ethyl acetate 6:4 as the eluent. 6 (12.7 mg, 90%). 1H NMR
(300 MHz, CDCl3): δ 7.97 (d, J=8.9 Hz, 1H, N-CAr-CHAr), 7.77 (d, J=16.6
Hz, 1H, CH=CH), 7.55 (d, J=16.6 Hz, 1H, CH=CH), 7.24-7.50 (m, 10H, CHAr),
7.22 (d, J=2.4 Hz, 1H, C=CH-C-OMe), 7.08 (dd, J=8.9 Hz, J=2.4 Hz, 1H,
CH=CH-C OMe), 4.80 (q, J=6.6 Hz, 1H, CH-O), 3.85 (s, 3H, OCH3), 1.56 (d,
J=6.6 Hz, 3H, CH3-CH-O) ppm. 13C NMR (75 MHz, CDCl3): δ 160.3 (N-C-S),
157.2 (C-OMe), 146.8 (C-N), 138.9 (C=C-CHOH), 138.6 (CAr), 137.1
(Ph-C=C), 135.0 (C-S), 134.6 (CAr), 129.6 (CHAr), 129.4 (2CHAr), 129.1
(CHAr), 127.7 (2CHAr), 127.6 (2CHAr), 127.1 (2CHAr), 126.5 (CH=CH), 123.2
(CH-C-N), 115.0 (CH=CH-C-OMe), 105.0 (CH-C-S), 69.7 (CH-OH), 55.4 (OCH3),
22.7 (CH-CH3) ppm. IR (CH2Cl2) ν 3321, 3311, 2985, 2929, 1734, 1548 cm-1.
Anal. Calcd. for C26H23NO2S: C, 75.52; H, 5.61. Found: C, 75.55, H, 5.59.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
